00:35:58.100 --> 00:35:59.880
and little by little they began to.

00:36:00.410 --> 00:36:14.300
it and little by little it began to take on a distinctive life of its own was that moment

00:36:14.300 --> 00:36:23.530
where in a group effort an individual might just shine on his own you know he had that space he

00:36:23.530 --> 00:36:29.310
