00:36:42.900 --> 00:36:46.400
as a means of expressing who I am

00:36:46.400 --> 00:36:47.700
and how clever I am,

00:36:47.920 --> 00:36:52.840
all within the bounds and bonds of the song, grew up.

00:36:58.500 --> 00:36:59.400
There was, as yet,

00:37:00.000 --> 00:37:06.180
There was no name for the music black and creole musicians began to play together at the dawn of the new 20th century.

00:37:08.020 --> 00:37:12.430
